{"id":"vod_lz_21197","vodId":"21197","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"东京食尸鬼","name_cn":"东京食尸鬼","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220603-1/3b7ce7d28dad936ee129d31cb2b6ab72.jpg"},"summary":"东京街头，数具男性尸体被发现，这是一场由“喰种”引发的大骚乱。大学生金木研（花江夏树 配音）原以为这一切离自己很遥远，直到一个夜里，他被自己心爱的女生袭击，原来她竟是以人肉为食的喰种。生命垂危的金木通过器官移植手术，才得以侥幸存活。而移植到金木体内的器官，来源竟然是喰种。 　　痊愈后，金木发现自己的身体有了某种奇怪的变化，他的一只眼睛出现喰种反应，而且他再也无法进食正常人的食物。让他感到可怕的是，他开始觉得“人类”才是满足自己食欲的对象。曾经只是一个普通人类的金木，难道从此走上狩猎人类、吞食尸体的喰种之路？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-06-03 22:45:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220603/22357_a0b99f6d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220603/22358_58eaa7e7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220603/22359_f056df34/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220603/22360_a99cb1d9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220603/22361_8437abd7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220603/22362_2f8788bc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220603/22363_b7ba3ec0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220603/22364_b8de921c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220603/22365_05398e0d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220603/22366_50209233/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220603/22367_fcaa86eb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220603/22368_251beb19/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:41:16.839Z"}